  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3202.25 Trail",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3202.25 “Trail” means the distance measured in inches between the point at which the steering axis intersects with the ground in front of the motorcycle and the point at which the forward limit of the wheelbase intersects with the surface below the motorcycle.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.16); renumbered by #12193 (from Saf-C 3202.22); renumbered by #13920 (formerly Saf-C 3202.24)",
